  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_jaksel",
      "name": {
        "en": "Jackie's Badge",
        "zh": "杰克证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "uniequip_001_jaksel",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Jackie has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for asserting the advantage in close-quarters combat.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Guard Operator during field operations to exercise Fighter responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员杰克擅长在近身格斗中取得优势\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为近卫干员，行使斗士职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_jaksel",
      "name": {
        "en": "D32 Steel Chair",
        "zh": "D32钢椅",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "X",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_jaksel",
      "description": {
        "en": "Earlier this week, law enforcement officials announced that the major kidnapping case that occurred earlier this weekend in Fussen Furnitureville has been cracked. All suspects are now in custody, and all hostages have been rescued and are currently receiving hospital treatment. Based on facts previously made available by the police, the syndicate responsible has been active in this state as well as our three neighbors, with a focus on hijacking and kidnapping. Seventeen cases this year alone have been linked to them, all striking panic in the populace. Working across state lines to follow developments in the case, Homeland Security employed disciplined units under a single chain of command to finally put this malicious gang behind bars. Justice has finally been served, and the citizens' lives and property safe once again.\nHowever, this week some have continued raising doubts about the police announcement, claiming that credit for the breakthrough goes to a young officer from the auxiliary forces, who is presently unnamed but has captured public attention in recent days. Following the end of the case, footage from a number of mall cameras has circulated on the intercity net. They show a young Perro female in a city police uniform but without a badge hopping onto the furniture store's roof from a nearby building, marking the start of a one woman chase—and eventually brawl—with the gangsters, lasting a whole forty minutes, and ending with her pacifying them all before law enforcement arrived bizarrely late to the scene. The young woman in the video is exceptionally athletic, making use of furniture from every room of the house to contend with the gangsters, skillfully enough to leave many wide-eyed. In the most viral clip, eight of them have her surrounded with edged and bolt-loaded weapons, then in the blink of an eye she grabs a mysterious weapon—said by the store's owner to be no more than a steel chair whose unique design struggled to sell—after which she subdues all the gangsters in short order. The public will not be forgetting her heroism any time soon.\nIn response to these inquiries, law enforcement official have stated that despite her nonstandard uniform, the woman in footage was in fact a special agent they dispatched to the precinct to secretly tail the gang, with orders to take action from within and subdue the criminals. The idea that the footage shows a 'vigilante' or 'police nonfeasance' is categorically false, and rumors that their department and the criminals were 'in cahoots' are not only utterly baseless, but 'harmful to police image.'\nIn contrast, eyewitnesses report that after singlehandedly taking down over a dozen gangsters and freeing the hostages, the mysterious young woman was promptly arrested and taken away by police. Some have even identified her as possibly the valorous officer who rescued a number of people during a major Originium safety accident last year, and exposed the former mayor's misdeeds. Law enforcement officials have yet to comment on this. We have made a request for this 'special agent' to come to our station for an interview, which the police have refused, citing her current hospitalization.",
        "zh": "本周稍早，本市警方宣布，上周末发生在富森家具城的特大绑架案正式告破，所有涉案犯罪分子已经悉数落入法网，所有人质均已获救，目前正在医院接受治疗。据警方早前公布的信息来看，这是一个在本州与相邻三州之间流窜作案的犯罪集团，专事劫持绑架，仅今年年内犯案就多达十七起，引发社会恐慌，引起跨州安全部门的密切关注。在安全部门的严密部署和统一指挥下，这一恶性犯罪团伙终于不再逍遥法外，正义得以伸张，市民的生命财产安全得到保障。\n然而，本周内不断有市民对警方的公告提出质疑，称此次案件告破实际应归功于近日来受到热议的一位不知姓名的年轻辅警。自案件侦破后，一系列商场监控画面在本市城际网络流传。视频显示，一位身穿本市辅警制服却未佩戴警徽的年轻佩洛女性从隔壁的建筑跳上家具城楼顶，与歹徒在楼内展开了长达四十分钟的追逐和搏斗。在她孤身将歹徒全部制服后，警方才姗姗来迟。视频中这位年轻女性身手不凡，利用各类家具与歹徒周旋的技巧令人大开眼界。在传播最广的一段视频里，她被八名手持利刃和弓弩的歹徒包围，转眼间又凭借随手抄起的一件神秘武器——据家具城老板说，其实是一把有着独特设计而正面临销售困境的钢制椅子——将歹徒悉数制服，其神勇英姿令市民印象深刻。\n针对有关质疑，警方回应，虽未穿着常规制服，但视频中的女性确为警方派遣的特勤人员，按照部署暗中跟踪该团伙，接受指令后方采取行动牵制歹徒。社会上传闻的“义警”“警方不作为”等说法为误传，至于“警队勾结罪犯”等谣言更是空穴来风，“有损警方形象”。\n但有目击者称，视频中这位独自击败十余名歹徒、解救人质的神秘女子在警方到达后即被拘捕带走。也有市民指认，这位神秘女子疑似为去年的重大源石安全事故中勇救数人、揭发前市长劣行的英雄警官。目前，警方尚未对上述质疑做出回应。本台此前已发出采访这位“特勤人员”的请求，警方以她正在接受看护治疗为由回绝。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ],
